<Attribute name="&apos;qso start&apos;" id="A72187AD-31F4-E60E-62E5-7124F5EFD363">
<createdBy>jtimothycollier</createdBy>
<createdTime>2019-07-02 05:04:02 UTC</createdTime>
<comment>Date stored in UnixEpoch form.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Date Conversion - Julian to UNIXEpoch&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;UNIXepoch date = ([Julian Date] - 2440587.5 ) * 86400&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Julian Date = ([UNIXepoch Date]/86400) + 2440587.5&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;SQL Example:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;select &apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;                                                    as Start_Date&lt;br/&gt;        ,julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;)                                     as Julian_Date    &lt;br/&gt;        ,(julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;) - 2440587.5)*86400    as UNIX_Epoch&lt;br/&gt;        ,datetime(julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;))                     as from_Julian&lt;br/&gt;        ,datetime((julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;) - 2440587.5)*86400,&apos;unixepoch&apos;) as  from_Unix_Epoch&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</comment>
<generatorID>0443AE73-6C14-0067-B51C-18A8252AB3E9</generatorID>
<notes>Date stored in UnixEpoch form.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Date Conversion - Julian to UNIXEpoch&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;UNIXepoch date = ([Julian Date] - 2440587.5 ) * 86400&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Julian Date = ([UNIXepoch Date]/86400) + 2440587.5&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;SQL Example:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;select &apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;                                                    as Start_Date&lt;br/&gt;        ,julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;)                                     as Julian_Date    &lt;br/&gt;        ,(julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;) - 2440587.5)*86400    as UNIX_Epoch&lt;br/&gt;        ,datetime(julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;))                     as from_Julian&lt;br/&gt;        ,datetime((julianday(&apos;2019-07-01 11:29:00&apos;) - 2440587.5)*86400,&apos;unixepoch&apos;) as  from_Unix_Epoch&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</notes>
